    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "The actions already in execution order, flattened when the subscriber
      list changes rather than\n walked through two indirections on every invoke.
      These fire several times a frame with every\n per-frame system in the process
      subscribed, so the dispatch itself is worth keeping flat.\n\n It also makes
      the invoke re-entrancy-safe: a subscriber that removes itself while being called\n
      mutates the lists, and iterating a snapshot means that cannot walk off the
      end mid-dispatch."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
