    Summary: "Batches every active mirror's distance-tier evaluation into one Burst
      job per frame instead of\n per-mirror managed math inside onBeforeRender. Rates:
      0 = frozen (beyond CullDistance, keeps the\n last image), 1 = every frame,
      2/4 = every 2nd/4th frame. The half/quarter tiers only engage on\n Android
      standalone; on PC only the cull distance applies."
