    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Per-role tracker-to-bone rotation reference, captured at calibration:
      `Inverse(trackerWorld) *\n boneWorld`, so `trackerWorldLive * reference` is
      the tracker-implied BONE world rotation.\n A limb strap's clock angle around
      the limb is arbitrary and gets no `Recalibrated*` offset\n (those cover only
      head/hips/chest/feet/toes/shoulders), so a raw tracker rotation cannot be\n
      compared against a bone directly."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
