    Summary: "Awaits a setup slot for the current frame. Returns synchronously while
      the frame still has\n budget, otherwise yields frame-by-frame until one frees
      up. Honors `token`\n so a disconnect mid-wait cancels the pending load like
      any other await in the load path.\n Always makes progress (admits within BudgetPerFrame
      frames), so it can never hang."
