    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Developer-only diagnostic recorder for the local avatar calibration
      pipeline.\n When the \"Dump Calibration CSV\" developer toggle is on, every
      stage of calibration\n (spawn, T-pose, offset capture, post-zero) pushes the
      scales / positions / rotation\n eulers (plus raw quaternions) of the avatar
      root and each tracked bone into a flat\n table, which is flushed to a CSV under
      persistentDataPath/CalibrationDebug at the end\n of calibration. The gate is
      read once at Begin; when off, every Record\n call is a single bool check so
      it is free to leave the instrumentation in place."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
