      stage \"OffsetCapture\"\n and label=role, the virtualized device/bone-local
      poses BasisInput.CalculateOffset\n now uses (ScaledDeviceCoord, OutGoing local,
      OutgoingWorld, TposeLocalScaled), the live Unity\n transform world pose the
      old path read, the player root, and BOTH the legacy world-space\n inverse offset
      and the virtualized local-space offset so the two can be compared pass-to-pass\n
