      panel) + Accept/Decline.\n\n Built in code from layout-managed panel elements
      rather than the fixed Dialogue\n Panel prefab \u2014 that prefab has no content
      layout area, so a dropdown can't be placed\n in it. Routes to the notification
      list under do-not-disturb / while the admin or\n moderator panel is open, and
