    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Maximum number of avatar asset bundles that can be downloaded from
      the network\n concurrently. Downloads are bandwidth-bound: a small value keeps
      each transfer\n at full speed, while a large value splits bandwidth and makes
      every player wait\n longer on the loading avatar. Tune higher only if you have
      lots of bandwidth and\n the server is fast."
    Remarks: 
