      local player's own head casts shadows without rendering the head mesh\n in
      their view) mirrors the source mesh's blendshape weights every\n frame. When
      disabled (default), the duplicate keeps its initial\n blendshape pose and the
      per-frame ScheduleReadBlendShapes /\n ApplyShadowCloneBlendShapes work is skipped
      entirely."
