  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.Constraints.BasisConstraintSlot
    MemberName: AuthoredOrder
    Kind: Field
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "The order this constraint was authored in, baked once when the content
      was converted and\n never recomputed. Animation Rigging evaluates a rig in
      a fixed authored sequence, so that\n sequence is the answer \u2014 recomputing
      an order every rebuild would be both slower and less\n faithful than carrying
      across the one the rig already had. Lower runs first; slots with no\n baked
      order fall back to hierarchy depth."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
