    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "State for the BasisHighlight render feature.\n\n Two independent collections:\n 
      - Overrides records *capability* (renderer => (mode, mask material)).\n   
      Authored by BasisHighlightOverride.\n  - Active records *state* (renderer is
      currently highlighted).\n    Driven by hover/interaction code via Highlight
      / Unhighlight.\n\n The static methods are thin facades that delegate to Instance.
      An\n implementing application can replace Instance with a subclass during\n
      bootstrap to override highlight behavior without touching the static call sites."
