    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "AUTO-GENERATED by tools/neural_ik/train_swivel.py -- DO NOT HAND-EDIT.
      Re-fit and re-generate.\n Singularity-free v2 target, multi-seed smoothness-selected.\n\n
      A neural drop-in for BasisElbowFieldModel: predicts the elbow's POSITION in
      the mirrored body frame (3->24->16->3),\n which the caller feeds to BasisElbowFieldModel.BendDirection
      to project onto the reachable circle. Predicting a\n POSITION (not an angle)
      carries no reference direction, so it cannot inherit the vertical-limb\n hairy-ball
      singularity the angle formulation has. Same domain clamp as every other pole
      model.\n\n USAGE:  float3 e = BasisArmElbowNeuralFieldModel.Elbow(tipLocal);\n        
      float3 bend = BasisElbowFieldModel.BendDirection(tipLocal, e, out float conditioning);"
    Remarks: 
