      NUnit tests\n and the offline BasisCalibrationLockInSweep exercise the exact
      same formulas.\n\n   - Proximity: distance from a tracker to its prime spot
      -> a 0..1 \"lock\" weight\n     (0 far, 1 locked) and the sphere diameter that
      shrinks toward the spot.\n   - Foot alignment: a foot tracker's yaw off body-forward
      and tilt off level ->\n     a within-limits test plus a 0..1 score that colors
