    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "DriveTpose's anchor math, shared by everything that needs \"where the
      T-posed avatar is\n anchored\" WITHOUT reading the live avatar root: yaw-flatten
      the head, place the root so the\n head bone lands on the head. Reading the
      live AnimatorRoot instead is only valid in the\n instant after DriveTpose physically
      placed it \u2014 this derives the same frame from the head\n pose alone, so
      it also holds for captures where the avatar was never physically T-posed\n
      (device-reconnect offset captures, T-pose-free calibration)."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
