    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Extra tracking-space lift, in unscaled player metres, that keeps an
      arm-span-calibrated avatar's\n feet on the floor. Arm-span DeviceScale matches
      reach rather than eye height, so the scaled head can\n land below the avatar's
      standing eye and drop the body through the floor; this returns the upward\n
      lift that, added to the tracking-space yOffset (later multiplied by DeviceScale),
      lands the scaled\n feet on the floor. Returns 0 when the avatar would float
      instead \u2014 push-up only, never sinks the view."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
