    Summary: "True when the head sits at its calibration standing height: within\n
      HeadHeightBandFraction (of the standing eye height) of the head pose captured
      at\n ritual calibration. The gated quantity is the head CONTROL, which rides
      an avatar-proportional\n eye-to-head-bone offset below the raw eye \u2014 comparing
      head-to-head cancels that offset, where\n gating against the eye height itself
      sat the band off-center by the gap (often the whole band).\n Rejects seated/crouched
      play and a degenerate eye height."
