    Summary: "The asymptote. The elbow eases toward this and never reaches it, so
      the envelope is closed by\n construction rather than by a tolerance -- the
      same rational saturation, with the same slope-1\n handover, that BasisLegSolveCore.ClampKneeSwivelDeg
      uses on the knee. Slope-1 means NO derivative\n step: the elbow eases into
      the limit instead of hitting a wall, which is the difference between a\n guard
      and a pop."
