    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "The corrective swivel, in radians, about the shoulder->hand axis, that
      brings the elbow back inside\n the anatomical envelope. Returns exactly 0f
      when the elbow is already legal.\n\n `totalLen` is the whole arm (upper + lower):
      the margins are fractions of it, so the guard is\n SCALE-FREE -- a child avatar
      and a giant get the same posture, not the same centimetres.\n\n `torsoUp` is
      the TORSO's up (chest->neck), NOT the player root's. The law is only true in
      that\n frame -- see the frame note in this class's summary, which is measured.
      A world/root up turns\n this guard into a hazard the moment the user bends
      over.\n\n This overload declines the tie band entirely and is BIT-IDENTICAL
      to the pre-band guard, so every\n caller, test and offline sweep that has not
      been taught to carry a side is unchanged."
    Remarks: 
