    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Per-frame blend for a first-order lag of corner frequency `hz`, framerate\n
      independent. The exact exponential rather than the One-Euro's 1/(1+tau/dt)
      approximation --\n there is no reason to approximate when the closed form is
      one math.exp, and it keeps the drag\n identical across 72/90/120 Hz headsets
      instead of drifting with frame time.\n\n alpha -> 1 (no drag) as hz or dt grows;
      the time constant is tau = 1/(2*pi*hz)."
