    Summary: "Radians of extra bend budget per arm-length of REACH change, before
      MaxGain. Set to 0 to disable\n the radial budget entirely and get the pre-2026-07-22
      cap bit-for-bit.\n\n 3 because MaxGain * 3 = 15 rad/arm-length covers the field's
      own worst measured radial\n sensitivity anywhere the gate grants FULL trust
      (max 14.9 over conditioning >= ReachTrustHi),\n so a straight reach is never
      clipped where the term is allowed to act at all. It is a coverage\n bound on
      the field, not a fitted human number -- the 4.6x that sets MaxGain was measured
      against\n hand ROTATION and has no radial counterpart in the corpus (a real
      hand almost never moves purely\n radially: 1.34% of frames, where the mocap's
      own noise floor dominates the ratio)."
