  - TypeFullName: Basis.IK.BasisElbowSwingCapCore
    MemberName: ReachTrustLo
    Kind: Field
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 1
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Conditioning (BendDirection's lever arm, arm lengths) below which the
      radial budget is identically\n zero, and at or above which it acts in full.
      Both ends are measured, not chosen:\n\n   * BELOW: the four topological cores
      sit at 0.0001-0.0185, and the radial sensitivity that makes\n     radial budget
      dangerous is still 22.4 rad/arm-length at 0.06-0.08 against a 15 budget. So
      the\n     term must be fully off well before a core, not just at one.\n   *
      ABOVE: binned over 55,140 real corpus frames, 0.00% sit below 0.10 -- the whole
      distribution\n     is 0.10-0.50, 71% of it in 0.16-0.20. Full trust at 0.10
      therefore costs real reaching nothing,\n     and 0.10 is also where the field's
      worst sensitivity (14.9) drops under the budget."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
