    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Which side of its circle the elbow anatomy guard chose last frame,
      per arm. The guard's\n branch cut is IRREDUCIBLE -- identity-on-legal plus
      enforcement forces either a jump or unbounded\n gain, whatever the inputs --
      but the BUZZ is not: `s` at the top of the circle is noise, so the\n branch
      re-decided 92-110 times per 200 frames and dragged the elbow through 4-38 METRES
      of path\n for an input standing still. Hysteresis makes the flip points differ
      by direction of travel, so\n no azimuth re-decides: 0-1 flips. 0 = no history,
      which declines to the shipped behaviour."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
