    Summary: "Scapulohumeral rhythm: clavicular elevation + retraction as a function
      of humeral\n elevation and plane of elevation. Ships FALSE, unlike Shrug and
      Retraction which ship on --\n CMU carries no clavicle motion at all (RightShoulder
      channel range is 0/0/0 in every clip) so\n the corpus cannot validate it, it
      is headset-unverified, and it perturbs the humeral twist\n guard's segmented
      firing-rate calibration by up to ~15.8 deg at the extremes. Re-run that audit\n
      with this ON before flipping the default. Inert and bit-identical while false."
