    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Carries the baked Tpose* scalars to a new avatar size. They are DENOMINATORS
      of ratio tests whose\n numerators are read live, so a stale value does not
      degrade the test \u2014 it saturates it: the\n shoulder solve goes inert (rawReach
      never reaches ReachEngage), the shrug latches at maximum on\n the elbow-tracker
      path, squishMult pins at 1+boost, and ComputeNeckCue lands at the wrong distance\n
      from the head, which mis-cues DistributeSpineBend, ApplyTrunkCounterbalance
      and ApplyHipHinge.\n All of it inverts above 1x. No-ops before the first bake
      and when the size has not moved."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
