      thread. Same\n zero-window story as GatherNow \u2014 and transform writes have
      no inline job\n path at all, so this is a plain loop: a dozen SetLocalPositionAndRotation
      calls cost\n less than the write job's dispatch and fence did. Indexing directly
      also survives a\n destroyed bone, where the TransformAccessArray silently compacted
      and shifted every\n later write onto the wrong transform."
