    Summary: "Subject's FORWARD. A positive rotation about this side-bends the bone
      to the subject's LEFT\n (right-hand rule: +Y rotates toward -X about +Z). The
      lateral limit is symmetric, so which side\n is positive does not change any
      outcome -- but the sign is stated here because a comment that\n guesses is
      worse than no comment."
