    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "sin(trunk flexion): 0 upright, 1 folded to horizontal. The crouch sit-back
      should be weighted by\n (1 - this) so a waist-fold and a squat do not both
      claim the same pelvis travel.\n Left at 0 when the term is disabled (Gain or
      MaxShift 0), so the crouch fade switches off with it\n and \"gain 0\" is a
      true no-op for the whole feature rather than only for the shift."
