    Summary: "Framework-side connection orchestration, independent of any menu UI.
      Owns the\n disconnect/reconnect/bundle-load/connect sequence, the loading-bar
      progress\n reporting, and the `--connection=` command-line bootstrap so a headless
      or\n custom-UI application can connect without the Servers panel package present.\n
      The Servers panel (com.basis.provider.servers) is a thin UI on top of this."
