    Summary: "Panel-independent connection routine. Reports progress through the
      loading bar,\n disconnects any existing session, sets the network manager fields,
      loads the\n asset bundle, and triggers the connection. Host-mode configuration
      (server name,\n MOTD, locks, \u2026) is applied by the caller onto BasisNetworkManagement\n
      before invoking this; both the Servers panel Connect button and the\n `--connection=`
      CLI bootstrap call this directly."
