    Summary: "Phase 1 (main thread) then kicks off the parallel per-receiver compute
      (Phase 2) on a\n background task. Pair with CompleteNetworkCompute at the very
      top of the\n next Update \u2014 before any receiver mutation (main-thread action
      drain, join/leave,\n avatar calibration) \u2014 so the async pass can never
      race those writes."
