    Summary: "Called when the client receives a LoadResource message with LoadStrategy
      = 3 (Predownload).\n Downloads the content to disc so a later normal load is
      instant, but never spawns it and\n never reports readiness. The on-disc cache
      is the durable result, so the in-memory tracking\n entry is dropped immediately
      (no spawn signal will ever arrive for it)."
