    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Incrementally reconciles eyeTransforms + pairToSlot with the current\n
      eye-having slots. A joining player appends a single pair; a leaving player
      / lost eye bones is\n swap-back removed; an avatar reload re-points its pair
      in place. pairToSlot is rewritten for every\n live pair so snapshot reorders
      cost an int rewrite, not a transform rebind. Must run on the main\n thread
      with any in-flight eye job already complete (caller's responsibility)."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
