    Summary: "Pure local-space to panel-space mapping, kept free of component state
      so the\n convention \u2014 which physical corner is panel (0,0) \u2014 is pinned
      by tests rather than\n discovered in a headset. Both the ray and the fingertip
      path convert through here,\n so a mirrored axis is a single sign change in
      one place."
