  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.UI.
    MemberName: BeginFrame
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 1
    ParamNames:
    - isDown
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Called once per pointer per frame before any dispatch, so the press
      edge is measured\n against the input itself rather than against whichever panel
      is under it. Something\n already held when the pointer arrives on a panel must
      not press it \u2014 that is the\n spawned-menu phantom click the uGUI path
      already guards against."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
