  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.UI.BasisUIToolkitPointerIdentity
    MemberName: BasisUIToolkitPointerIdentity
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 1
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Assigns tracked pointer identity to UI Toolkit pointer events.\n\n
      UI Toolkit models XR pointers (PointerId.trackedPointerIdBase,\n PointerType.tracked)
      but exposes no public way to construct one \u2014 every\n public GetPooled
      overload derives its id from a mouse, touch or pen. The setters exist\n and
      are stable, so they are bound ONCE per event type into a cached delegate: no\n
      per-frame reflection, no allocation on the dispatch path.\n\n Binding failure
      is not fatal. If a future Unity renames these, Supported\n goes false and callers
      fall back to a single pen pointer \u2014 hover and click keep working,\n only
      per-device independence is lost."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
