    Summary: "A single entry tracked by BasisNotificationCenter.\n\n A popup that
      is closed before it has been accepted or denied is captured as a\n BasisNotificationStatus.Pending
      entry that keeps the live\n Reopen factory, so the original prompt can be brought
      back up and\n answered later. Popups that are answered immediately are stored
      as terminal\n history entries instead."
