    Summary: "Process-wide collection point for popups. Any popup that is closed
      before the\n user accepts or denies it is captured here as a pending entry
      that can be\n re-opened later; answered popups are kept as history. State is
      in-memory only\n and resets when the application restarts (pending entries
      hold live callbacks,\n which cannot be serialised across sessions)."
