    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "One weighted `RandomSelect` option. The slot's target eases to this
      rotation when a\n cycle's deterministic roll lands in `[bandLo, bandHi)` of
      the movement's total weight;\n the gap up to `totalWeight` is the idle band
      (pose nothing). Held in a buffer shared by\n every slot so the per-transform
      job stays allocation-free."
