  - TypeFullName: BasisAuthoredMotionSystem
    MemberName: BasisAuthoredMotionSystem
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 1
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Static orchestrator for authored-motion evaluation \u2014 a sibling
      to `RemoteBoneJobSystem`.\n Holds the persistent SoA + TransformAccessArray
      for every registered avatar's\n driven transforms and schedules one batched
      Burst pass per frame. Drives transforms outside the\n networked humanoid skeleton,
      so there's no write contention with the bone pipeline.\n\n \n\nRegistration
      is calibration-driven (no scene discovery): the local/remote avatar drivers\n
      call Register for each BasisAuthoredMotion on the avatar at calibration;\n
      recalibration re-registers (dedup drops the stale record) and a torn-down avatar's
      slots are\n reclaimed by the next Schedule rebuild. Authoritative state lives
      in managed\n `Registration` records (rest poses captured once at registration);
      a structural change\n rebuilds the native containers from them."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
    Since: 
    ObsoleteMsg: 
    Platforms: []
