    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "\u2B50 THE SEGMENTED REPORT. NEVER POOLED, AND THE EMPTY CELLS ARE
      PRINTED AS EMPTY.\n\n A cell the user never visited cannot referee anything,
      and the single most useful line in this\n report is the list of cells with
      too few frames to speak: that is the honest boundary of what\n the capture
      proves. Pooling across cells is what hid a band-specific breach twice this
      week."
