    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "The forward map the simulated device applies, exposed so a test can
      prove the reconstruction\n above actually round-trips through the real injection
      seam rather than merely looking correct.\n Kept byte-for-byte in the same operation
      order as BasisInputXRSimulate so the float error is\n the same float error."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
