    Summary: "The timestep the pipeline actually ran this frame. RECORDED BECAUSE
      REPLAY RATE CHANGES THE\n ANSWER: this codebase has shipped real framerate-dependent
      blends \u2014 a saturate(dt*speed)\n smoother whose time constant tracked GPU
      speed, and a self-referential slerp that converged by\n frame count rather
      than elapsed time. Replaying at a rate other than the recorded one is\n therefore
      legitimately a different experiment, not a regression."
