    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "One-time T-pose snapshot of the RAW avatar joints, captured per avatar
      load while the avatar\n is physically T-posed: role \u2192 unscaled, animator-root-local
      bone pose. This is the \"capture\n once at load, derive everything after\"
      source calibration consumes (arm span, offset\n references, offset reprojection)
      instead of re-reading live bones inside a T-pose window.\n NOTE: deliberately
      raw joints \u2014 the bone-control TposeLocal is a MODIFIED T-pose (spine\n
      snapped to the centerline, fallback-DB percentage positions) and cannot substitute
      for it."
    Remarks: 
