    Summary: Drives automatic facial blinking using skinned mesh blendshapes.
    Remarks: "This driver schedules pseudo-random blink events and animates eye-closure/opening\n
      by writing weights to a set of blink blendshapes on a SkinnedMeshRenderer.\n
      It also observes face visibility via BasisPlayer.FaceRenderer and disables\n
      updates when the face is not visible."
