    Summary: "Converts the managed PoseGrid into a flat NativeArray for Burst access.\n
      Per-finger layout: [fingerIdx * gridCount * 3 + gridIdx * 3 + jointIdx].\n
      Adjacent Y-cells land on the same cache line (48 bytes apart) instead of 10KB
      apart."
