    Summary: "Main-thread capture pump. Call at the top of the frame: reads every
      complete 20 ms\n chunk the clip has captured (Microphone.GetPosition / AudioClip.GetData
      are\n main-thread-only APIs) into the raw staging ring and wakes the processing
      thread,\n which then owns downmix, filtering, encode and the network send for
      the rest of\n the frame. Nothing joins back to the main thread except the mic-icon
      flags below."
