    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Vertical play-space offset (OVRAS Space-Drag style), in unscaled (real-world)
      metres. Injected\n into every device's Y in Device_Management.Devices.BasisInput.ComputeUnscaledDeviceCoord\n
      \u2014 the same hook seated mode uses \u2014 so the whole tracking space (view,
      hands, avatar) shifts up/\n down without moving the capsule or fighting gravity.
      Persists until dragged back or reset."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
