    Summary: "Notes the noisiest tracking technology feeding each body group, so
      the Auto preset can filter a\n group for the hardware it actually has. Recomputed
      rather than cached: devices connect, get\n re-roled by calibration, and on
      Quest a hand swaps between controller and camera tracking mid\n session, so
      a cached map would go stale silently. It is a dozen devices and only runs when\n
      something is set to Auto."
    Remarks: 
