    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Burst job that writes the avatar root's world position and rotation
      for all remote\n players. Uses the sRoots TransformAccessArray (1 entry per
      player). Inputs are the\n derived root pose computed inline by `BulkCopyHipsAndDeriveJob`
      from the\n network's hips world pose + the local hips deltas \u2014 root rides
      along so the\n hips bone lands exactly at the high-precision world pose we
      received."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
