    Summary: "Reads the FK-posed world pose (+ root local rotation) of the bones
      the end-effector IK needs, into\n flat buffers parallel to the skeleton TAA,
      and clears the per-bone override mask. Only the 12 effector\n slots (LHand/RHand/LFoot/RFoot
      \xD7 root/joint/tip) of players anchored THIS frame do the expensive\n transform
      read \u2014 every other bone just clears its (cheap byte) mask and returns.
      Scheduled after the\n skeleton FK + hips-world apply so the world poses are
      final."
    Remarks: 
