  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.Networking.Sync.Testing.BasisSyncLatencyMatrix
    MemberName: BasisSyncLatencyMatrix
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 1
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Diagnostic sweeps for BasisSyncLatency. Each group isolates one latency
      lever so the\n CSV makes the contributor obvious:\n   - send-rate:   20/30/60
      Hz at point-blank, perfect wire (the floor every object pays).\n   - distance:   
      distance reduction ON, 20 Hz, sweeping nearest-viewer distance (the practical
      killer).\n   - no-reduction: the same distances with reduction OFF (flat control
      \u2014 proves it's the throttle).\n   - jitter:      one-way jitter at 20 Hz
      point-blank (drives the dynamic-depth climb).\n   - extrapolate: on/off under
      jitter (shows extrapolation masks gaps but doesn't cut steady latency)."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
