    Summary: "Runs the REAL Burst InterpolateSyncObjectsJob over a driver-style multi-slot
      SoA layout,\n mirroring how BasisSyncDriver packs every remote object into
      shared pools and interpolates\n them in one pass. This lets the offline harness
      produce its \"other side\" output with the real job instead\n of a managed
      mirror, so the multi-slot base arithmetic and the inactive-slot skip get exercised
      \u2014 the\n parts a single-slot fidelity pin can never reach."
