    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "A scene of several synced objects sharing one wire. Adds the interactions
      a single-object run can't reach:\n the real batch coalescing/demux (many objects'
      payloads framed into one datagram and split on the far side,\n with shared-fate
      loss), the real Burst interpolation over a multi-slot driver SoA, and a late-joiner
      that\n only recovers via a keyframe."
