    Summary: "Offline exerciser for a BasisSyncSceneScenario. Drives K real senders/receivers
      over a shared\n seeded network; in Batched mode it coalesces each frame's keyframes
      and deltas through the real\n BasisSyncBatchWriter and demuxes them via BasisSyncBatchReader.
      Produces one\n BasisSyncSimResult per object so each object's convergence is
      scored independently."
