    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "How committed THIS step is, 0 = deliberate .. 1 = full speed. Published
      by the sim job at the\n instant the step is requested and consumed by BasisLocalFootDriver.FinalizeStep,
      which used to re-derive\n urgency from sim state -- one fewer mirror to drift.
      Carries the drift term the job's global urgencyT\n cannot see: how far past
      its trigger this particular foot is."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
