    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Toe MTP bend, degrees, from the toe surface probe. Positive = dorsiflexion
      (toes UP, the foot\n bending over a rise); negative = plantarflexion. 0 when
      the toe probe found nothing to conform to, which\n includes overhanging an
      edge -- a toe with no ground under it stays where the animation put it rather
      than\n reaching into a void. Consumed by the FBIK job's toe stage, NOT by the
      sim job."
