    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Smoothed |d(smoothedVelocity)/dt|, m/s\xB2. Drives the acceleration
      term of step urgency: it is\n non-zero at the instant a move STARTS (when speed
      is still ~0) and at the instant it STOPS (when speed\n is falling), which is
      exactly where a speed-only urgency reads backwards. Scale-invariant \u2014
      see\n k_AccelUrgencyRef."
