  - TypeFullName: Basis.IK.Mocap.BasisBalanceSummary
    MemberName: ComHeightFracHead
    Kind: Field
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Whole-body CoM height over head-joint height, at the clip's tallest-head
      frame, both\n measured from the floor. Dempster puts a standing human's CoM
      at 0.553 of stature; the head JOINT\n is not the top of the head, so the expected
      ratio here is around 0.6. This is the cheapest\n independent check that the
      mass model is not nonsense -- drop the trunk and it collapses, put the\n head
      mass in the trunk and it sags. It is checked by the tests against a literature
      band, not\n against a number this file produced."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
