    Summary: "\u26A0 NOT A RATCHET YET. The thresholds below are DELIBERATELY loose:
      they are set to catch \"this is not\n a body that could stand up\", not to
      police posture quality, because the honest tight numbers do not\n exist until
      the corpus has been measured (see BasisBalanceCorpusTests, which reports rather
      than\n gates on first run). Tighten them from the measured table, not from
      taste."
