      from a collapsing lever arm\n is noise. Below this perpendicular offset (fraction
      of leg length) the channel reports nothing\n rather than reporting a random
      sign -- the same \"no circle, no test\" discipline\n BasisElbowAnatomyTests.RequireInReach
      enforces. 0.015 of an 0.85 m leg is ~1.3 cm, the lever\n below which every
      roll/flip singularity in this codebase has lived (BasisLegSolveCore)."
