    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "The verdict, in the shape of BasisMocapAccuracy.Gate / BasisMocapFootQuality.Gate.\n\n
      \u2B50 WHAT IS AND IS NOT GATED, AND WHY IT MATTERS THAT THE LIST IS SHORT.
      Only channels whose limit\n is an ALREADY-MEASURED law gate: the elbow ceiling
      (55,140 frames), the knee's anterior half-space\n (a hard geometric guard),
      and the spine table (corpus-vetoed under 0.6%). Everything else is\n reported.
      That is not timidity -- a gate on a guessed threshold either fires on real
      humans, in\n which case it gets disabled and stops protecting anything, or
      it is set so loose it never fires,\n in which case it was decoration. Read
      the report, then move a channel's `Gated` to true."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
