      count, frame time and the\n loader's SourceToMetres are carried through untouched;
      only positions move, and only because\n their bones changed length.\n\n The
      returned clip's Name carries the scale suffix ALWAYS, including at 1.0x. No
      special case:\n the identity guard compares the accuracy summary's numeric
      fields one by one and says so, which\n is stronger than letting a name match
      paper over a field it forgot to check."
