      the solver.\n\n Every existing row returns false, which is the property the
      additive guarantee rests on: the\n three places this is consulted (the TipRotation
      gate, the knee One-Euro gate, and Gate itself)\n all evaluate exactly as they
      did before for every row that shipped before this one."
