  - TypeFullName: Basis.IK.Mocap.BasisSyntheticTrackerRng
    MemberName: BasisSyntheticTrackerRng
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "A small, explicit, seeded PRNG. SplitMix64.\n\n NOT UnityEngine.Random:
      that is global mutable state, so any other code touching it would silently\n
      change this model's answers, and a test whose answer moves run to run is worse
      than no test. Not\n System.Random either -- its float output is not guaranteed
      identical between Mono and CoreCLR, and\n this model is compiled by both (Unity's
      test runner and dotnet build). SplitMix64 is integer-only\n until the final
      division by a power of two, so the uniform stream is bit-identical everywhere."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
