    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Which frames popped. Needed because comparing pop COUNTS against a
      reference does not\n answer the question anyone is actually asking: a solver
      that pops on exactly the frames the HUMAN\n popped on has invented nothing,
      and one that pops the same NUMBER of times somewhere else has\n invented all
      of them. Only a frame-by-frame comparison can tell those apart. Index i = the
      step\n from frame i to i+1."
    Remarks: 
