    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Spectral arc length (Balasubramanian et al. 2015, J NeuroEng Rehabil
      12:112) of a speed\n profile. Dimensionless, and invariant to BOTH movement
      amplitude and duration -- which is\n what lets it be compared across avatar
      scales and across clips of different length, and is\n why it beats a raw jerk
      integral as a portable smoothness number.\n\n Calibration standard: a minimum-jerk
      reach scores -1.40 (we measure -1.397). More negative\n = less smooth. Guarded
      by BasisMotionAnalyzerTests -- if that number moves, this is broken."
