  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.Networking.Compression.
    MemberName: CompressHipsDelta
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 3
    ParamNames:
    - delta
    - buffer
    - 32767
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Encodes a hips local-position delta (vs TPose) as 3 signed shorts\n
      (transmitted as ushorts) clamped to \xB1BasisAvatarBitPacking.HipsDeltaRange\n
      meters per axis. 6 bytes total \u2014 rides in the avatar packet tail so\n
      seated/IK hips overrides reach remotes. Signed encoding means a\n zero-byte
      tail (e.g. from a test client that doesn't fill the field)\n decodes to zero
      delta rather than a clamped extreme.\n\n Takes this namespace's own `float3`\n
      (Basis.Scripts.Networking.Compression.float3) \u2014 kept as a\n plain POD
      struct so the wire layer doesn't drag a Unity.Mathematics\n dependency into
      server-side callers. Unity-side callers convert from\n Unity.Mathematics.float3
      at the call site."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
    Since: 
    ObsoleteMsg: 
    Platforms: []
