    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Sends and receives session-scoped \"temp block\" notifications between
      peers on\n BasisNetworkCommons.EventsChannel using\n BasisNetworkCommons.EventType_PlayerTempBlock.\n\n
      The block a user sets in their own UI is persisted locally via\n BasisPlayerSettingsManager.
      This handler mirrors that block onto\n the *other* party in the current session
      so the block is effective both ways \u2014\n when A blocks B, B also can't
      see/hear A. The mirrored state is runtime-only\n (never written to B's settings
      file) so A unblocking reliably restores visibility\n and B's settings aren't
      polluted by other users' choices."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
