  - TypeFullName: BasisPickupSyncNetworking
    MemberName: FullRateWhileHeld
    Kind: Field
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "While a player holds this prop, ignore distance-based send-rate reduction
      so the item being actively\n manipulated and watched stays full-rate (otherwise
      its send rate \u2014 and therefore the remote jitter\n buffer that rides on
      it \u2014 is throttled by distance to the nearest viewer, which is the main
      cause of\n laggy held props at range). Turn off to keep legacy distance throttling
      while held."
    Remarks: 
