    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Whether the AudioSource should currently be enabled. True while real
      audio is\n queued, and for a short hang afterwards so brief inter-word/sentence
      gaps don't\n disable+re-enable the source \u2014 that churn restarts Steam
      Audio's per-source\n state and clicks on every resume. We still disable once
      the stream has been\n fully silent for IdleResetThresholdUnits (the same point
      the decoder resets), so\n genuinely idle players don't keep a live spatialized
      voice source \u2014 which is\n what matters at 1000+ players."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
