    Summary: "Re-seeds the bone shimmer filter for a player by zeroing its recursive
      state (the\n sentinel), so a (re)calibration or reused slot starts the low-pass
      from the first real\n cubic value instead of blending up from the previous
      occupant's bones. Cheap (BoneCount\n writes). Caller must have completed oneEuroJob
      (EnsureSlotInitialized does)."
