    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Combined Burst job that does the entire pre-apply pre-compute pass
      for\n one player in a single sequential pass:\n   1. Copies filtered hips world
      pos/rot from the network's per-key slot\n   2. Copies scale + scale-change
      flag\n   3. Reads filtered hips local deltas (no separate temp buffer)\n  
      4. Reads per-player TPose hips local pos/rot from caller-supplied arrays\n  
      5. Derives the root world pose via inverse math (conjugate, not inverse)\n
      Replaces what used to be three separate dispatches (BulkCopyHipsAndScale,\n
      BulkCopyHipsLocalDeltas, ComputeRootFromHipsJob). Saves dispatch\n overhead
      at thousand-player scale and removes a round-trip through two\n persistent
      temp buffers, keeping each player's work in cache."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
