    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Single combined voice buffer that handles both:\n 1. Encoded packet
      reordering (jitter buffer) \u2014 accepts out-of-order Opus packets\n 2. Decoded
      PCM frame queue \u2014 serves OnAudioFilterRead with arbitrary sample counts\n\n
      Replaces the separate BasisJitterBuffer + BasisVoiceRingBuffer pair.\n Decoded
      frames are stored as discrete 20ms chunks (not a flat sample ring),\n eliminating
      the overwrite-and-stall problem of the old ring buffer."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
