  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.Networking.Sync.BasisSyncCodec
    MemberName: BasisSyncCodec
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 1
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Wire (de)serialization for a BasisSyncSchema. Supports full keyframes
      (every\n field) and dirty-mask deltas (changed fields only). The header and
      dirty mask stay byte-aligned;\n field payloads are packed into a contiguous
      bitstream so continuous components can use any bit\n width (Raw 32-bit float,
      Half 16-bit, or N-bit Ranged within [min,max]) and bools cost one bit.\n Rotations
      use Basis smallest-three quaternion packing; discrete ints use zig-zag varints."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
