    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Generic networked value container. Declare typed fields (position/rotation/scale/float/int/ushort)\n
      with the Register* calls in Awake, then on the owner call LocalSet each frame
      and on every other\n client read RemoteGet \u2014 values arrive smoothed through
      a playback buffer with interpolation.\n Owner-authoritative (grab via TakeOwnership);
      only the owner's writes go on the wire.\n Optionally BindTransform so a remote
      transform is driven automatically by the Burst apply job."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
