      roughly this many staged\n frames ahead of the interpolation window \u2014
      the dominant, fixed share of perceived latency. 2 (default)\n matches the historical
      smoothing; 1 roughly halves the buffer latency (snappier, less tolerant of\n
      jitter/loss). Re-apply with ApplySyncConfig() if changed at runtime."
