      with indices as this\n object's own schema offsets (the driver rebases them
      into the shared pools). Returning false\n leaves the object entirely on the
      main-thread ApplyInterpolated path;\n `replacesMainThreadApply` additionally
      suppresses the main-thread call when\n the binding covers everything it would
      do (a BindTransform binding does not \u2014 both ran before\n and still do).
      Evaluated at every layout rebuild; call\n BasisSyncDriver.MarkLayoutDirty after
      changing what it depends on."
