    Summary: "True once an idle owner has delivered the whole backoff ladder plus
      `maxAtCap`\n keyframes at the capped interval. Keyframes are reliable, so remotes
      hold the converged state\n without further re-sends; late joiners are covered
      by OnPlayerJoined (forced keyframe/snapshot)\n and any change resets both counters."
    Remarks: 
