    Summary: "Rigidbody sibling of BasisSyncedTransform. The owner streams the body's
      world position and\n orientation (with the same per-axis compression and rotation
      modes) plus linear / angular velocity; every\n other client drives its copy.
      Remote bodies are made kinematic by default so physics never fights the\n synced
      pose \u2014 turn that off to feed the synced velocity into a live simulation
      instead. Owner-authoritative;\n call TakeOwnership() (e.g. on grab) to become
      the authority."
