    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Request that playback collapse to the freshest received frame on the
      next Advance,\n skipping interpolation. Use after a discontinuity in what the
      synced values mean (teleport, or a\n pickup switching between world-space and
      hand-relative encoding) so the remote copy snaps rather\n than sliding across
      the jump."
