    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "\u2B50 THE BAND FUNCTIONS MUST BE TOTAL, AND THEY MUST REJECT RATHER
      THAN GUESS.\n\n A NaN elevation filed into band 0 poisons the 0-30 deg percentile
      with a frame that is not\n evidence about anything, and it does it silently.
      `(int)(NaN / 30f)` is not a compile error and\n not a crash -- it is a number.
      So both band functions are written reject-unless-good and return\n -1, and
      this proves it for every hostile input rather than trusting the shape."
