  - TypeFullName: Basis.Tests.IK.
    MemberName: TheTrackerPath_IsUntouchedByTheSeamCap
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 1
    ParamNames:
    - MakeRig(
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: " <summary>\n \u26A0\uFE0F THE SEAM CAP IS INSIDE `if (!i.HintIsTracker
      && ...)` AND MUST STAY THERE. The tracker path\n has its own forearm roll with
      its own bound and its own wrap fade, tuned against a measured\n strap; this
      gate pins that the no-tracker fix did not leak into it. The tracker path's
      wrist\n residual is near zero BECAUSE it routes pronation into the forearm
      from the measurement -- that\n is the behaviour being protected.\n </summary>"
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
