    Summary: "The cap is anatomy, not a tuning knob: a human elbow does not lock
      out at 180 under load, and an\n avatar whose arm snaps dead straight reads
      as robotic. Pinned so a well-meaning \"let the arm\n straighten fully\" change
      has to come and delete this test on purpose."
