    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "...AND IT MUST NOT COST REACH. The swivel is about the shoulder->hand
      axis by name, and the hand\n LIES on that axis, so full hint authority cannot
      move the hand. Structural, not tuned -- pinned so\n nobody \"fixes\" the elbow
      by trading the hand away."
    Remarks: 
