    Summary: "AND THE CAP MUST NOT HAVE EATEN THE ORDINARY REGIME. Below the crossing
      where `PI - |twist|`\n overtakes the correction (|twist| ~ 158.3 deg) the cap
      does not bind and the guard is the exact\n saturation it always was. If a future
      change makes the cap bind earlier it would quietly stop\n enforcing the hard
