    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Solve(T . inputs) == T . Solve(inputs) for any rigid T. \"The avatar
      behaves the same wherever you\n stand and whichever way you face\", stated
      formally.\n\n \u26A0\uFE0F BindHumerusRefAxis is deliberately NOT transformed.
      It is a BONE-LOCAL axis, and rotating it\n with the world would be testing
      a different -- and wrong -- contract. If a future change makes\n the core treat
      it as a world vector, this test goes red, which is the point."
    Remarks: 
