    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "AND THE TORSO FRAME MUST BE THE FRAME THE LAW IS EVALUATED IN -- not
      merely consulted. Take a\n pose, rotate the whole arm AND the torso frame together
      (the user bends over, their arm goes with\n them), and the answer must be the
      same answer rotated. Then feed the SAME bent-over arm an\n UPRIGHT torso up
      -- the shipped defect -- and the guard must visibly change its mind, or the\n
      equivariance above is not testing anything the frame does."
    Remarks: 
