    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "The bend-plane fallback chain (stable down-pole, then hint, then shoulder->target,
      then\n PlayerUp) only runs when the ANIMATED arm is dead straight, which no
      ordinary pose reaches -- so\n it is four branches nothing normally exercises.
      This enumerates which of them are reachable at\n all and reports the rest,
      because a branch nobody can reach is a branch nobody can have tested."
