    Summary: "AND THE WHOLE CHAIN, ADDED UP. Each link on its own can look defensible
      while the total does not:\n a shoulder, a forearm and a wrist each 'only' near
      their limit compose into an arm that has\n rotated further than a person can.
      This is the assertion that no per-joint gate can make."
