    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "A puck bolted to the limb. It rides the limb's roll, so swivelling
      the arm by phi about\n the shoulder->hand axis rotates the puck by phi about
      that same axis -- which is the entire reason\n its ROTATION still carries an
      azimuth after its POSITION has collapsed onto the axis. The rig\n supplies
      this through BasisLimbRollStore; a zero here would leave the anchor's carry
      at identity,\n i.e. a plain hold, and would be testing a rig that does not
      ship."
    Remarks: 
