    Summary: "NON-RECURSIVE by design. The corpus is tiered (root 20 / posture 44
      / dynamic 29 / slow 16) and the\n tiers are isolated on purpose: a recursive
      load would let a clip dropped into dynamic/ silently move\n the root tier's
      reported numbers, which is how a ratchet quietly stops meaning anything."
