    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "\u2B50 THE RULER-GUARD FOR (B). Every GATED channel's limit is a law
      somebody already measured, so\n real humans must sit inside it. A failure here
      is not \"a human did something impossible\" -- it is\n this file measuring
      the wrong quantity, or a limit being wrong.\n\n THE UNGATED CHANNELS ARE REPORTED,
      NOT ASSERTED, and that is the honest state: their limits come\n from the clinical
      literature and have never been confronted with this corpus through this code.\n
      The table below is what turns them into gates -- see the report test."
    Remarks: 
