    Summary: "The other half of the same claim: not merely \"the chest does not move
      with the head\" but \"the\n chest is where the tracker says it is\". Measured
      11.68 deg before the fix and 1.45 after.\n\n The residual is not zero and is
      not supposed to be: ReassertTrackedChest re-clamps against the\n POST-solve
      neck and spine through MaxChestDeltaProperty, which is the same bound the pre-solve\n
      write has always used, and that clamp is allowed to bite.\n\n Paired with the
      same measurement on the no-chest branch, where nothing ever writes the tracker\n
      and the error must be large -- otherwise this would pass on a corpus where
      the solved chest\n happened to sit near the measurement anyway."
