  - TypeFullName: Basis.Tests.IK.
    MemberName: TheHeadIsStillPinnedToItsTarget
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 1
    ParamNames:
    - TestContext.WriteLine(s_Report
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "THE FIX MUST NOT BE \"PIN THE CHEST AND ABANDON THE HMD\". ReassertTrackedChest
      re-applies the\n measurement and then restores the head with the joints ABOVE
      the chest only -- upperChest and\n neck -- which have spare DOF precisely so
      the head can come back without disturbing what was\n just pinned. If that restore
      were dropped, every chest assertion in this file would still pass\n while the
      avatar's head sat somewhere the headset is not.\n\n The cost of the trade is
      real and lands on the NECK (+4.4 deg mean of bend), which is a posture\n question
      and not a placement one; this test only guards placement."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
