    Summary: "Synthesises a device stream shaped like a real session: believable
      poses, a non-uniform\n timestep (a real 90 Hz session hitches), a mid-stream
      dropout, a mid-stream role reassignment,\n and a populated calibration block
      with a non-identity OffsetCoords."
    Remarks: 
