  - TypeFullName: Basis.Tests.IK.
    MemberName: NonFiniteSamples_SurviveRoundTripUnlaundered
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 1
    ParamNames:
    - 1f
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Guards against silent NaN/Infinity laundering. A tracker that glitched
      and emitted a non-finite\n pose is EVIDENCE; a codec that quietly normalises
      it to zero destroys the only record of the\n glitch and turns the recording
      into a lie. Note this cannot be written with ordinary equality \u2014\n NaN
      != NaN \u2014 which is exactly why every comparison in this file is on raw
      bits.\n Headroom: none by design."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
    Since: 
