    Platforms: []
  - TypeFullName: Basis.Tests.IK.
    MemberName: VersionMismatch_IsRefusedAndNamesBothVersions
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 1
    ParamNames:
    - 4
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Guards the version field's whole purpose. These files are fixtures
      and will outlive the code\n that wrote them, so a stream from a future or past
      layout must be REFUSED, not guessed at \u2014 a\n silently misparsed recording
      would produce confident, wrong regression results. The message\n must name
      both versions so the reader knows which build to go find."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
