    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Guards the FILTER-STATE hazard's declared half. Filter state is carried
      across frames even\n though bone pose is not, so a replay is only valid played
      from frame 0 and its leading frames\n are warm-up whose output must not be
      measured. The warm-up count is part of the contract and\n must survive the
      round trip, or a consumer will measure frames whose filters had not converged\n
      and read the difference as a regression."
    Remarks: 
