    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "The same determinism property across the FILE boundary: a recording
      written, read, written and\n read again must replay identically to the original
      in memory. This is what \"permanent test\n data\" actually requires \u2014
      the fixture has to survive a trip through the disk format without\n changing
      what it asks the solve to do, however many times it makes that trip.\n Headroom:
      none by design."
