    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "The cap is worth having only if it holds for extension caps OTHER than
      today's 170. Sweeping it\n is what turns \"the two constants happen to agree\"
      into \"they cannot disagree\".\n\n Before the fix this failed for every theta
      at or above 2*acos(2*SoftMarginFracLimb) = 168.52 deg,\n which is 0.99499 of
      reach -- comfortably inside the range anyone would consider setting."
    Remarks: 
