    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "AND IT CHANGES NOTHING WHERE IT HAS NO BUSINESS CHANGING ANYTHING.
      The cap binds only where\n SoftMarginMaxFracRadius*radius < SoftMarginFracLimb*arm,
      i.e. radius/arm < 0.1, i.e. past\n ~0.98 of reach. Below that the margins are
      the same floats they always were, so the guard is the\n same guard -- which
      is what makes this a targeted fix rather than a retune of everything."
    Remarks: 
