    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "\u2B50 THE ANATOMY. Measured over 55,140 frames of real human arm motion:
      THE ELBOW NEVER RISES ABOVE THE\n SHOULDER, NOR ABOVE THE HAND -- whichever
      is higher. Worst violation in the entire corpus: 9 mm.\n\n Note it is NOT \"the
      elbow is always below the shoulder\": with the hand overhead a human's elbow
      really\n is above their shoulder, on 71.9% of such frames. The law is the MAX
      of the two, and this pins both\n halves so a fix to one cannot quietly break
      the other."
    Remarks: 
