    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Chicken-wing elbow-flare regression tests (no elbow tracker). Exercise
      the pure, stream-free\n BasisElbowFlareCore directly -- the same Core the live
      rig\n (BasisFullIKConstraintJob.ComputeArmBendFromLookup) and the offline BasisArmIKSweep.RunChickenWing\n
      harness call -- and verify the user-felt properties:\n\n   1. PUSH OUT   --
      turning the controllers inward pushes the derived elbow OUT toward the half-T-pose\n                   
      mark (the requested \"push the elbows out\").\n   2. HARD CLAMP -- a committed
      chicken-wing never crosses the halfway line to straight-out-to-the-side\n                   
      (the requested \"should never exceed the halfway 90 deg mark\"), and never
      wings UP.\n   3. NO-OP OFF  -- with no inward roll the flare is an exact no-op,
      so normal reaches are untouched.\n\n Swivel is measured in BasisElbowFlareCore's
      own basis: 0 deg = elbow straight down, +cap = out toward\n the body's outward
      side. Engagement is the chicken-wing amount (the live rig derives it from the\n
      controller roll; here it is passed explicitly so the clamp/push geometry is
      checked deterministically)."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
