    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "ANTI-TAUTOLOGY. Proves the LEGACY elbow filter genuinely snaps at full
      extension, so the gates above\n cannot be passing for some unrelated reason,
      and a revert of k_ConditionElbowSwivelOnPole fails loudly."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
