  - TypeFullName: Basis.Tests.IK.
    MemberName: FootTargetRotation_DegenerateOffset_DegradesToSentinelNotNaN
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 1
    ParamNames:
    - -8f
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "A degenerate OFFSET must degrade to the sentinel, never to NaN.\n\n
      A serialized Quaternion defaults to (0,0,0,0) -- NOT identity -- and Quaternion.Inverse
      divides by the\n squared norm, so inverting it yields NaN. The window is real:
      the offset is only assigned when the avatar\n has that foot mapped, and recalibration/avatar-swap
      rewrite it live. And a NaN here is not a glitch, it\n is terminal: a NaN'd
      bone transform in Unity PERSISTS, so the rig dies and never recovers."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
