  - TypeFullName: Basis.Tests.IK.BasisHipFrameSpringTests
    MemberName: BasisHipFrameSpringTests
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Tests for BasisHipFrameSpringCore -- the implicit-Euler, critically-damped
      angular spring\n that smooths the hips rotation feeding the no-elbow-tracker
      bend frame, so hip jitter/sway no longer\n wobbles the derived elbow pole (\"more
      spring around the hip so its movements don't affect the connecting\n bones
      as much\"). The rotational analogue of BasisChestSpringCore, so the guarantees
      mirror that gate:\n\n   1. STABLE   -- implicit Euler never diverges (NaN/blow-up),
      even at high Hz / low fps.\n   2. CONVERGE -- a static target is reached (no
      steady-state error).\n   3. LAG/NO-OVERSHOOT -- a step is followed with a smooth
      lag and, critically damped, never overshoots.\n   4. JITTER REJECTION -- high-frequency
      input is attenuated far more than low-frequency (the whole point)."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
