    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "The hip hinge -- the pelvis' share of a bend-over (lumbopelvic rhythm).
      Past StartDeg of head-over-hips\n forward lean the pelvis follows the lean
      (PelvisFollowSlope ~1.0), eased toward MaxAddDeg. The curve is\n FITTED to
      real humans; the corpus test at the bottom checks it actually reproduces them.\n\n
      \u26A0\uFE0F GATING lives in the JOB, not this core: BasisFullBodyIK.SolveSpine
      calls ApplyHipHinge ONLY when\n there is no hip tracker -- a tracked pelvis
      is the user's own and must feed straight through."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
