    Summary: "Head pitches MUST span both sides of MaxHeadPitchDeg (80). The head-pitch
      clamp is a branch that only\n runs past that threshold, and it used to measure
      pitch against WORLD up (world XZ as the horizon,\n Cross(Vector3.up, ...) as
      the yaw axis) while the rest of the core used ReferenceUp -- so the core\n
