    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Anterior for the leg's own frame. Building this from Cross(axis, up)
      is DEGENERATE for a near-vertical\n leg and silently places azimuth 0 behind
      the knee, which parks a whole sweep in the posterior\n half-space and makes
      the guard appear to fire everywhere. That mistake produced two confident, wrong\n
      findings while this was being diagnosed."
