    Summary: "Snap ceiling for the solved knee, deg of knee per deg of hint. The
      pre-fix fold measured 714x in the\n solve core (3572x through the clamp alone);
      the shipped narrow-window taper\n (KneeAnteriorTaperStartDeg 160 + smoothstep)
      lands at 6.69x, which is the deliberate price of keeping\n the old posture
      and the noise dead zone below 160deg. This gate exists to catch a return of
      the FOLD,\n so it sits just above the shipped figure rather than at the 5x
      that predated that taper."
