    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "The mismatch sweep. Arm 0.8x-1.3x and leg 0.85x-1.2x span what avatars
      actually do to people:\n 0.8 is a stylised short-armed character worn by an
      adult (the case the shipped bug was about --\n the user's hand goes where the
      avatar's arm cannot follow, permanently), 1.3 is a long-limbed\n character
      worn by someone smaller.\n\n ONE GROUP AT A TIME, never a cross product. A
      cell with both arm and leg mismatched confounds\n two causes, and the per-joint
      degradation is exactly what we are trying to attribute."
    Remarks: 
