    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "GUARDS: that a rescaled clip is still an anatomically sane human. BasisBvhLoader.Validate
      is the\n handedness guard the whole corpus rests on -- left hand on the body's
      LEFT, knee anterior to the\n hip->ankle line -- and it is exactly the kind
      of property a rebuild could quietly invert (a sign\n slip in the displacement
      would mirror a limb while leaving every length correct).\n\n Run across the
      ENTIRE sweep grid, not just the corners: the anterior-knee check is a majority\n
      vote over sampled frames, and a mid-range scale is as capable of tipping it
      as an extreme one.\n HEADROOM: Validate's own (it demands a clear majority,
      not unanimity, because a walking arm\n legitimately crosses the midline)."
    Remarks: 
