    Summary: "\u26A0 A TRANSCRIPTION of BasisMocapAccuracy's private Limb / SeedLimb
      / AnimatedPose, not a call:\n they are private and BasisMocapAccuracy is off-limits
      to edit. The PRE-IK limb, modelled the way\n the runtime produces it -- a fixed
      bind pose riding the parent, rebuilt from scratch every frame,\n with IK layered
      on top, exactly as the Animator re-evaluates its base layer. If BasisMocapAccuracy's\n
      version changes, change this one. See the class header for why the difference
      matters."
