    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Turn the user round, move them across the room: the girdle must come
      out rotated by exactly the\n same amount and every scalar it reports must be
      untouched.\n\n \u26A0\uFE0F ChestBind and the T-pose data are deliberately
      NOT transformed. ChestBind DEFINES the\n anatomical frame and the T-pose rotations
      are read only RELATIVE to the live chest, so a global\n re-orientation must
      leave them alone -- transforming them would be testing a different, and\n wrong,
      contract. That the result is still equivariant is precisely because the core
      reads them\n relatively."
