    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "The girdle is clamped, it never rolls with the arm, and each of its
      three contributors must be\n shown to ENGAGE somewhere -- a shrug, a retraction,
      and the coupled swing.\n\n \u26A0\uFE0F THE TWIST LEAK IS MEASURED FROM THE
      APPLIED ROTATION, NOT FROM r.TwistLeakDeg. The core\n computes that field AFTER
      it strips the twist, so it is ~0 by construction and asserting on it\n proves
      only that subtraction works. The clavicle SWINGS the arm root; it does not
      roll with it,\n and that is a statement about the quaternion that reaches the
      bone."
