    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "\u2B50 elbowTrust FAILS OPEN, AND WHICH WAY A GATE FAILS ON MISSING
      DATA IS A DESIGN DECISION THAT\n DESERVES A TEST. TposeElbowLength == 0 means
      \"the caller did not bake one\", NOT \"the tracker is\n wrong\": starting from
      zero trust would read absence as maximum doubt and collapse the whole solve\n
      to the hand-path reach gate for every caller that omits it. Both halves are
      asserted -- absent\n data trusts, and BAD data (an elbow tracker far past where
      an elbow can be) does not."
