      of the model and the one a\n naive implementation gets wrong. The girdle's
      rate late in the arc must be about 3x its rate in\n the setting phase \u2014
      that factor is exactly the cited shift from 5:1 (share 1/6) to 1:1 (share 1/2).\n
      Mutation: k_RhythmLateRateMul = 1 (a single constant ratio). The measured factor
      drops to 1.00."
