    Summary: "BIND INDEPENDENCE \u2014 the defect's root cause, pinned. Clinical
      elevation does not depend on what\n the artist authored, so a T-pose rig and
      an A-pose rig must get the SAME rhythm at the same real\n arm elevation, even
      though their coupled-swing angles differ by 60 deg.\n Mutation: drive the term
      from `swingDeg` (the pre-existing swing-from-bind). The four binds then\n disagree
      by more than 10 deg."
