    Summary: "IT SKIPS `engage`, deliberately, and this pins why in its sharpest
      form. `engage` is\n `setting * reachFade`, and `setting` is built from swing-from-bind
      \u2014 which on a T-pose bind is\n 0.00 at exactly the arm-horizontal pose
      where clinical clavicular elevation is already ~16 deg.\n Scaling by `engage`
      would zero the term at the pose it exists for.\n Mutation: multiply the contribution
      by `engage`. This reads 0.00 and fails."
