      chain, mirroring\n BasisFullIKConstraintJob.BuildSpineAnatomy (and identical
      to the bake in\n BasisTrackerConfigMatrixTests, deliberately, so the two harnesses
      stay comparable). The head\n (chain 0) and the hips (chain 5) are left Valid=false
