    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "\u2B50 THE MODEL MUST NOT BE READING UnityEngine.Random.\n\n Global
      mutable RNG state is the classic way a \"deterministic\" harness stops being
      one: some\n unrelated code draws from it, and the corpus numbers move for no
      reason anybody can find. This kicks\n the global state hard between two otherwise
      identical runs and demands the output be bit-identical."
