    Summary: "\u2B50 THE PROMOTED MODEL MUST BE THE MODEL IT WAS PROMOTED FROM.\n\n
      BasisArmTrackerHintAuthorityTests carries a one-off strapped-puck model whose
      parameter ranges were\n calibrated against a real user complaint. This file's
      job is to generalise it, not to replace it --\n so the generalisation is cross-checked
      against a verbatim copy of the original, across the original's\n own swept
      stand-offs and its own extension range.\n\n If this fails, every conclusion
      the arm tests reached and every conclusion drawn through the shared\n model
      are about two different pucks."
