    Summary: "The eye and mouth roles reach SetInitialData through GetWorldSpacePos,
      which took an avatar-LOCAL\n point out to world. Both halves of that path used
      to be translation-only, so the two errors\n cancelled and eye/mouth came out
      correct by accident. Fixing only the world->local half would have\n silently
      broken them. This gate pins the round trip that must hold for BOTH halves."
