  - TypeFullName: Basis.Tests.IK.
    MemberName: TheRuler_ReproducesTheShippedCorpusFigure
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 1
    ParamNames:
    - subset."
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "GUARD THE RULER. Reproduces BasisSpineCorpusAccuracyTests' shipped
      pooled accuracy figure\n (1.86 cm mean / 8.56 cm p95 over Spine+Chest+UpperChest+Neck
      on its ten-clip set) using THIS\n file's rig, clip loader, gaze frame and centimetre
      metric, running that test's exact code path\n (DistributeSpineBend + SolveSequentialSpineIK,
      hips planted on the bone).\n\n WHAT IT GUARDS: every other number this file
      prints. The matrix measures a dispatch layered on\n top of this same rig; if
      the rig, the clip set, the frame stride, the gaze construction or the\n error
      metric drifts from the shipped ruler, the matrix rows are measuring a system
      the runtime\n never produces and the table is fiction. This project has shipped
      that mistake before.\n Headroom: mean is allowed +-0.30 cm and p95 +-1.20 cm
      around the shipped figures -- slack for\n float summation order only, nowhere
      near enough to hide a different pipeline."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
