    Summary: "A REAL crouch must read identically with and without a space drag:
      the posture model's inputs\n are body-relative, so drag + crouch must equal
      crouch, shifted. Guards against the fix\n over-correcting (e.g. lifting the
      normalisation denominators, which would change how deep the\n same physical
      crouch reads once dragged)."
