  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.UI.NamePlate.BasisNamePlateOverlayLimiter
    MemberName: BasisNamePlateOverlayLimiter
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 1
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Bounds the per-frame cost of the TMP-based nameplate overlays \u2014
      chat bubbles and\n avatar-loading displays \u2014 regardless of player count:
      only the\n MaxVisibleChatBubbles / MaxVisibleLoadingDisplays nearest\n to the
      viewer actually render; the rest keep their state but their objects are\n deactivated
      and skip every text/mesh write. Fed by the driver's existing per-plate\n loop
      in BasisRemoteNamePlateDriver.CompleteNamePlates (BeginFrame \u2192\n Consider
      per plate \u2192 Apply), so plates never register themselves and there is no\n
      stale bookkeeping. Selection math lives in BasisNamePlateOverlayCore."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
