    Summary: "The device's hardware serial as reported by its runtime (OpenVR Prop_SerialNumber_String,\n
      OpenXR input device description serial), empty when the backend doesn't expose
      one. Unlike\n UniqueDeviceIdentifier this carries no session-volatile device
      index, so\n integrations can recognize a specific physical or virtual device
      across reconnects\n (e.g. SlimeVR's virtual trackers serialize their body part
      as \"human://WAIST\")."
