    Summary: "Faithful data model + stepper for BasisLocomotion.controller (com.basis.sdk).
      The tables mirror\n the asset exactly \u2014 state set, transition order, blend-tree
      child positions/time scales, exit\n times \u2014 and BasisLocomotionGraphParityTests
      re-derives them from the asset in the editor, so a\n controller edit fails
      the test instead of silently diverging from this stepper.\n Scope is deliberately
      the stock controller only: avatars that ship their own controller keep the\n
      engine Animator path (see BasisLocomotionPoseSystem)."
