      component-free copy of the\n avatar's skeleton (same Avatar asset, so the humanoid
      retarget is Unity's own \u2014 no muscle math\n re-derived here). Runs a fixed
      number of graph evaluates per tick so an avatar load never pays\n the whole
      bake in one frame; the engine Animator path keeps running until the bake is
      Ready."
