    Summary: "The lift-poison guard, pinned on the exact pair recovered from a poisoned
      install: a saved\n eye of 1.992 m against a span of 1.507 m is anatomically
      impossible (that span implies a\n ~1.5 m body) \u2014 it is a calibration taken
      while vertically shifted and must never persist.\n Honest short-armed players
      stay inside the band."
