    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "End-to-end cover for the batched constraint solver: real components,
      real transforms, the\n real sample/solve/write jobs. Each case asserts against
      the transform after a full\n BasisConstraintSystem.Schedule / BasisConstraintSystem.Complete\n
      pair, so a regression anywhere in the flatten \u2192 solve \u2192 write chain
      shows up here rather\n than only in a scene.\n\n Registration is driven explicitly
      instead of through `OnEnable`: the system installs its\n cross-assembly subscription
      from a `[RuntimeInitializeOnLoadMethod]`, which never runs in\n an EditMode
      test. BasisConstraintSystem.Register is idempotent, so these tests\n behave
      identically if a prior play session already wired the subscription up."
    Remarks: 
