    Summary: "Latency characterization for the generic value-sync path. Where the
      codec/receiver/convergence\n tests ask \"is the value correct\", these ask
      \"how late is it\" \u2014 the axis behind the in-practice\n lag. They drive
      the REAL BasisSyncReceiver through BasisSyncLatency.Run and pin both the absolute\n
      floor and the relative effect of each lever (send rate, distance reduction,
      jitter buffer), so a\n future latency fix has a green/red signal and a regression
      has a tripwire."
