    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Pushes the user-chosen jitter buffer depth into RemoteOpusSettings.JitterBufferSize.\n
      The encoded-packet release gate (`_receivedSinceStart < InitialBufferDepth`)\n
      is only consulted during the initial fill, so a mid-stream change wouldn't
      be\n audible until the next mute\u2192unmute cycle. To make the slider act
      NOW we also\n BasisVoiceBuffer.Reset every live receiver, which costs a brief\n
      (~100 ms) audio gap as the buffer refills at the new depth.\n Clamped to 1
      so we never disable the gate entirely."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
