    Summary: "Search the WHOLE swivel circle instead of only the natural->outDir
      arc. A grid sweep has\n no previous frame, so the anchor is the natural pole
      (PrevSwivelDeg = 0), which measures the pure\n DOMAIN effect with no temporal
      component -- exactly the comparison the gate wants. Off by default\n so the
      historical sweep numbers stay reproducible."
