    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Menu hooks for the runtime knee-swivel recorder. Enter Play, Start,
      then spend a few seconds in the pose\n where the bad knee actually misbehaves
      -- stand, shift weight, take a step, sit if that is where it shows\n -- and
      Stop + Dump. The console prints a LEFT vs RIGHT table and names the asymmetry;
      the CSV is there for\n the frame the number goes bad.\n\n Use it when one knee
      is wrong and the other is not: the solve path is mirror-symmetric, so that
      pattern\n means the two legs are being handed different data, and this says
      which field differs."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
