  - TypeFullName: BasisGizmoManager
    MemberName: BasisGizmoManager
    Kind: Delegate
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 1
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Runtime debug-gizmo drawing. The Create/Update/Destroy id API is retained
      so callers\n can hold onto gizmos across frames, but the backend is batched:
      spheres and lines are\n plain data slots submitted once per frame as a handful
      of draws \u2014 instanced meshes for\n spheres, a single dynamic ribbon mesh
      for every line \u2014 so cost scales with visible\n geometry instead of GameObject
      count. Text labels stay TextMeshPro objects (pooled),\n and only the MaxVisibleLabels
      nearest the viewer render at once, which\n bounds the TMP re-tessellation cost
      regardless of how many labels exist.\n Render must run once per frame; SMModuleDebugOptions.Simulate
      drives it."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
