    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "World-space debug text label for a gizmo. Created in code (no prefab)
      so the\n text system is self-contained; the underlying TMP_Text picks up\n
      the project's default TMP font on AddComponent. Per-frame mutations are cached\n
      so a label whose value hasn't changed does not re-tessellate the text mesh
      or\n touch the color buffer; colors within ~1.5% per channel count as unchanged
      so a\n continuously-lerped health tint doesn't dirty the mesh every frame.
      Labels are\n pooled and visibility-capped by BasisGizmoManager, which toggles
      the renderer\n through SetVisible rather than deactivating the GameObject."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
