  - TypeFullName: Basis.MediaPipe.MediaPipeHandConverter+RotationFilter
    MemberName: RotationFilter
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Same two-clock split the arm positions use: one-euro on the camera's
      delta when a fresh sample lands,\n then a carry slerp every rendered frame.
      Running the filter at render rate over a held sample makes\n each new sample
      look like a burst of speed, which is what snaps the wrist between poses."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
