    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Lowest reported visibility across the shoulder, elbow and wrist of
      one arm. The pose model emits a\n full 33-landmark skeleton every frame whether
      or not it can actually see the limb, extrapolating\n the parts it cannot \u2014
      so an arm out of frame or behind the back still produces confident-looking\n
      garbage. Returns -1 when the model reports no visibility at all, meaning \"do
      not gate on this\"."
