  - TypeFullName: Basis.MediaPipe.Tests.
    MemberName: ANaNLandmark_IsRefused_NotRetargeted
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 1
    ParamNames:
    - float.NaN
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "A Burst abort, pinned. NaN fails every ordered comparison, so a `x
      < epsilon` degeneracy guard lets\n it straight through; it then latches into
      the one-euro filters (which lerp it forward forever) and\n finally reaches
      the IK job, where the arm-bend lookup does `(int)NaN` == int.MinValue and kills
      the\n process with no managed stack. Refusing the frame costs one frame of
      arm and is recoverable."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
