    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "A URL resolver registered with BasisMediaUrlRouter. Several resolvers\n
      can be registered at once; the router tries them in descending Priority\n order
      (registration order breaks ties) until one takes ownership of the load. A\n
      resolver that declines lets the router fall through to the next one, and finally
      to a\n direct load. Resolvers route only \u2014 they never gate host trust
      (that's\n BasisMediaPlayerSecurity)."
    Remarks: 
