    Summary: "Bridges the BasisSettingsDefaults.EnablePassthrough setting to\n BasisPassthroughFeature
      and the local camera. While active it clears the main\n camera to transparent
      and removes the skybox (both the camera component and RenderSettings)\n so
      the real world shows through; it saves and restores the world's values on toggle
      and\n re-captures them on each scene load. Only takes effect on standalone
      VR hardware whose\n runtime supports passthrough."
