      recorded thread of the most recent frame via ProfilerDriver +\n RawFrameDataView,
      plus FrameTimingManager CPU/GPU numbers, plus the\n existing Basis network
      counters and BasisEventDriverProfilerData\n fields. Writes:\n   ProfilerCaptures/frame_<ts>.json 
      \u2013 full per-thread sample tree\n   ProfilerCaptures/frame_<ts>.md    \u2013
      human-readable digest (clipboard too)\n   ProfilerCaptures/frame_<ts>.data 
