  - TypeFullName: BasisAuthoredMotion
    MemberName: BasisAuthoredMotion
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: MonoBehaviour
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Data-only avatar component declaring authored, deterministic dynamic
      motion on transforms\n the humanoid rig and IK don't drive (tail/ear chains,
      accessories, etc.). It holds pure\n serialized configuration and runs no per-instance
      per-frame `Update` \u2014 all runtime\n evaluation happens in the batched `BasisAuthoredMotionSystem`
      job, which reads this\n component at calibration. The config model mirrors
      BasisParameterDriver's\n `Operation[]` shape (an enum kind + per-kind fields).\n\n
      Allow it onto an avatar by adding its type to the Content Police\n (`ContentPoliceSelector.selectedTypes`
      in `AvatarContentPoliceSelector.asset`).\n Group movements that toggle together
      into one component; an avatar may carry several."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
