    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Shared, read-only baked motion for a BasisAuthoredMotion.Movement of
      kind\n `Sequence`: an AnimationClip's curves sampled to a fixed-rate, blittable
      buffer so the\n batched Burst job can interpolate without touching a managed
      `AnimationCurve`. One asset\n is referenced by every instance of an avatar;
      per-instance runtime state is just a playhead.\n Rotations bake as absolute
      local rotations and the job writes them straight to the bone, so a\n converted
      clip reproduces its authored pose exactly regardless of the avatar's rest pose."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
