    Summary: "Kind tag stored parallel to BasisContentHarvest.Components so consumers
      can\n dispatch on a byte (jump table) instead of an is-chain, then reinterpret
      the reference with\n BasisContentHarvest.UnsafeAs{T}. Removed marks a slot
      whose\n component was destroyed during the content walk; never reinterpret
      those."
