    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Reinterprets `Components[i]` as `T` with no runtime type check.\n The
      caller MUST have matched `Kinds[i]` to `T` first and must\n never call this
      on an BasisComponentKind.Other or\n BasisComponentKind.Removed slot. Unchecked
      \u2014 a wrong tag is memory-unsafe \u2014\n and does not test for a destroyed
      component, so only use it while the snapshot is unmutated."
    Remarks: 
