    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Logs at error level but marks the emission as not-reportable, so BasisExceptionNotifier\n
      skips the user-facing dialogue and the crash report sent to the server. Use
      for genuine\n errors that are caused by remote content or the environment rather
      than a client defect\n (bad media URL, unapproved component in someone else's
      avatar, no XR runtime present) \u2014\n they belong in the log, but they are
      not this client crashing.\n Thread-safe: the flag is per-thread, and Unity
      raises the log callback synchronously on\n the thread that emitted it."
    Remarks: 
