      source list: the first\n source is the 0 end, the second is the 1 end. The
      Basis stand-in for Animation Rigging's\n `BlendConstraint`.\n\n Sources past
      the first two are ignored for the blend itself, but they still register as\n
      dependencies, so a source driven by another constraint is still solved first."
