    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Reaches a chain of any length toward a target \u2014 tails, tentacles,
      spines, anything longer than\n the two bones BasisTwoBoneIK handles. The Basis
      stand-in for Animation Rigging's\n `ChainIKConstraint`.\n\n Sits on the tip
      bone; root names where the chain starts and must be an ancestor\n of it. The
      IK target is the first source, so a target that is itself constrained still
      solves\n first. Solved with FABRIK, which reaches forward from the tip and
      back from the root until the\n tip is within tolerance or the iteration budget
      runs out."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
