    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Converts one component if it is something we replace, reporting whether
      the caller should\n now destroy it. Built to be called from a walk the caller
      is already doing \u2014 Content Police\n visits every component on load anyway,
      and walking the hierarchy a second time to find\n constraints would cost more
      than the conversion does.\n\n Returning true always means \"destroy this\",
      including for the rig scaffolding, which has\n nothing to convert but must
      not outlive the constraints it drove."
