      sources' world rotations.\n The Basis stand-in for `UnityEngine.Animations.RotationConstraint`.\n\n
      Blending is the hemisphere-corrected quaternion average used throughout Basis,
      then masked per\n axis in ZXY euler order \u2014 the same order Unity's constraint
      uses, so authored per-axis rigs\n carry over unchanged."
