    Summary: "Drives a transform's local scale from the weighted average of its sources'
      lossy (world) scales.\n The Basis stand-in for `UnityEngine.Animations.ScaleConstraint`.\n\n
      The blend happens in world scale and is divided back through the parent's lossy
      scale, so a\n constrained child tracks its source's apparent size regardless
      of where either sits in the\n hierarchy."
