    Summary: "Callback so other scripts can remap their own data after we strip/bake.\n\n
      Called once per SkinnedMeshRenderer that was processed, AFTER the new mesh
      is assigned.\n\n Params:\n - buildRoot: the clone root being built\n - avatarOnClone:
      the clone avatar component\n - smr: the renderer whose mesh was replaced\n
      - oldMesh: the original mesh before strip/bake\n - newMesh: the new stripped
      mesh asset that is now assigned\n - keptBlendshapeNames: blendshape names that
      still exist on newMesh (excluded from baking)"
    Remarks: 
