    Summary: "Server-only outbound channel carrying multiple avatar quality messages\n
      to a single receiver, LZ4-compressed into one UDP datagram that fits the peer
      MTU.\n Wire format:\n   [count:1][rawLen:2-LE][LZ4 block( [origChannel:1][msgLen:2-LE][bytes]*
      )]\n Each inner [origChannel] is the byte-id or ushort-id avatar quality channel\n
      the message would have been sent on individually (channels 6-13 / 41-48).\n
      Compression: LZ4Codec.Encode at LZ4Level.L00_FAST (K4os.Compression.LZ4 1.3.x)."
    Remarks: 
