    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "When true, the reduction system sends periodic full avatar keyframes
      and, in between, sends\n only the fields that changed since the last keyframe
      (per-bone dirty mask) on\n DeltaAvatarChannel. Cuts server\u2192client bandwidth
      heavily for idle/distant avatars. When false,\n every send is a full keyframe
      (legacy behavior). Clients must implement the delta decoder."
