    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Milliseconds between forced full avatar keyframes per sender when delta
      compression is on.\n Lower = faster recovery from a lost keyframe over unreliable
      UDP, but more keyframe bandwidth;\n higher = smaller average bandwidth but
      longer worst-case staleness. 500ms is a balanced default."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
