    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Ceiling for the adaptive keyframe stretch. While a sender's deltas
      stay tiny (idle avatar)\n the periodic keyframe interval doubles per streak
      of small deltas, up to this value; any\n real motion snaps it back to AvatarDeltaKeyframeIntervalMs.
      Receivers that miss a keyframe\n request one on demand (v42 DeltaControlKeyframeRequest)
      instead of waiting the stretch out.\n Set to 0 (or at/below the base interval)
      to disable stretching."
