    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 1
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Server-side receiver for client error/exception reports sent on\n BasisNetworkCommons.EventsChannel
      with sub-byte\n BasisNetworkCommons.EventType_ErrorReport.\n\n Wire (client\u2192server):
      [eventType:1][severity:1][lenPrefixed PermissionCompression blob of (system,
      message, stack)]\n\n The reporting client never sends its own identity \u2014
      the authoritative UUID,\n display name and platform are attached here from
      the peer's connect metadata.\n Only the first occurrence of each unique error
      per user (this server session)\n is written, to CrashReports/<uuid>.jsonl.
      Gated by BasisCrashReportStateManager."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
