    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Server-side relay for voice-record consent messages sent on\n BasisNetworkCommons.EventsChannel
      with sub-bytes\n BasisNetworkCommons.EventType_VoiceRecordRequest and\n BasisNetworkCommons.EventType_VoiceRecordConsent.\n\n
      A recorder asks a recordee for permission to capture their voice; the recordee\n
      replies with a consent decision. The server does not evaluate consent \u2014
      it only\n rewrites the payload with the sender's peer id and forwards it to
      the single\n target peer, mirroring the temp-block relay."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
