    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Writes the identity quaternion (0,0,0,1) into a 7-byte smallest-three\n
      slot. Identity has w as the largest component (= 1), so:\n   index byte = 3
      (drop w)\n   three small components = 0 \u2192 quantized = midpoint = 32768"
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
