    Summary: "Resend an unchanged pose at least this often (seconds). The server
      serves late joiners\n and lost-baseline receivers from its own cached keyframes
      (v42 adds request-driven\n re-keys), so the heartbeat only bounds staleness
      for edge cases; P2P peers additionally\n get a forced send whenever the session
      set changes."
