    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Normalises a scale before it is quantized. A default-constructed message
      carries 0, which is\n what makes \"unset\" mean \"no deformation\" \u2014 and
      it must be mapped to 1 BEFORE compression,\n because the quantizer would otherwise
      clamp 0 to FitScaleMin and halve every fitted bone."
    Remarks: 
