    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Advanced word filter using homoglyph detection and trigram-based false
      positive prevention.\n Adapted from KoboldKare's word-filter package by naelstrof.\n
      Detects banned words even when obfuscated with Unicode lookalikes or inserted
      characters,\n while avoiding false positives like matching \"ass\" in \"assignment\"."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
