    Summary: "Deferred avatar send recorded once per (sender,receiver) pair in the
      inner loop.\n We keep a reference to the shared pre-serialized source plus
      the per-receiver\n interval byte; the flush stage decides whether to compress
      these into one bundle\n or replay each as an individual SendUnreliableRawMerge."
    Remarks: 
