    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Master switch for distance-ordered shedding. When false the server
      keeps the old behaviour\n of slicing only \u2014 every receiver's rate drops
      uniformly under load, and no player is ever\n dropped outright. Leave it on
      unless something depends on distant players always updating."
    Remarks: 
