  - TypeFullName: BasisNetworkServer.BasisNetworkingReductionSystem.TailStats
    MemberName: TailStats
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Dedicated tick loop on its own thread. Targets ~250Hz (4ms) while players
      are\n connected and parks (~0% CPU) when the server is empty. The inter-tick
      wait uses\n AutoResetEvent.WaitOne so an idle or under-budget loop never burns
      a core; the OS\n timer is raised to 1ms (Windows) so the wait keeps ~4ms accuracy."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: True if this tick did any distance work (so profiling only counts real
      work).
    Value: 
