  - TypeFullName: BasisNetworkServer.BasisNetworkingReductionSystem.
    MemberName: TryGetJoinSnapshot
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 3
    ParamNames:
    - viewerPosition
    - subjectId
    - snapshot
    ParamDocs:
    - "The joining player's world position, decoded from the ready message it just
      sent. It is\n passed in rather than looked up because AddMessage only QUEUES
      the join pose \u2014 PlayerState\n (and its Position) is not created until
      the ~250Hz tick drains that queue, so a lookup here\n would race the tick and
      fall back to High for some joiners and not others."
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Greedily packs as many pending messages as fit into MTU-sized compressed\n
      bundles, emitting each on BasisNetworkCommons.CompressedAvatarBundleChannel.\n
      Uses a per-receiver EMA of the compressed/raw ratio so the first deflate\n
      attempt usually succeeds; on overshoot we shrink using the actual observed\n
      ratio and retry once. Returns the index of the first not-yet-emitted entry
      \u2014\n callers send the [cursor, count) tail uncompressed."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
    Since: 
    ObsoleteMsg: 
    Platforms: []
