    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Propagates AdditionalAvatarData from the high quality message to lower
      quality variants.\n BuildAllLowerFromHighInto only handles the muscle/position/rotation
      payload;\n additional data (blendshapes, custom avatar behaviours) must be
      propagated separately.\n When StripAdditionalDataAtLowQuality is on, Low and
      VeryLow drop it entirely \u2014\n face/detail data is invisible past the Medium
      distance, and the reliable AvatarChannel\n path still carries low-frequency
      behaviour state to everyone."
    Remarks: 
