  - TypeFullName: BasisNetworkServer.BasisNetworkingReductionSystem.ShardedConcurrentDictionary
    MemberName: ShardedConcurrentDictionary
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: System.Collections.Generic.IEnumerable<System.Collections.Generic.KeyValuePair<int,
      TValue>>
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 1
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Power-of-two-sharded ConcurrentDictionary<int, TValue> replacement.
      Splits writes\n across N=NextPow2(ProcessorCount) inner dicts indexed by a
      scrambled key, so per-bucket\n lock contention drops by ~N\xD7 under ingress
      storms (HandleAvatarMovement \u2192 currentMessages\n and ProcessMessage \u2192
      playerStates upserts at 1k+ players, 250Hz). Reference-swappable \u2014\n preserves
      the existing Interlocked.Exchange double-buffer pattern. Enumeration walks\n
      shards sequentially and inherits ConcurrentDictionary's per-shard snapshot
      semantics."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
    Since: 
    ObsoleteMsg: 
