    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: Gets the ID of the time source used by the server or Kiss-o'-Death code
      sent by the server.
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: "ID of server's time source or Kiss-o'-Death code.\n Purpose of this property
      depends on value of NtpPacket.Stratum property.\n \n\n\n\n\n Stratum 1 servers
      write here one of several special values that describe the kind of hardware
      clock they use.\n \n\n\n\n\n Stratum 2 and lower servers set this property
      to IPv4 address of their upstream server.\n If upstream server has IPv6 address,
      the address is hashed, because it doesn't fit in this property.\n \n\n\n\n\n
      When server sets NtpPacket.Stratum to special value 0,\n this property contains
      so called kiss code that instructs the client to stop querying the server."
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
    Since: 
    ObsoleteMsg: 
    Platforms: []
