  - TypeFullName: LiteNetLib.Utils.
    MemberName: CheckTimestamps
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 1
    ParamNames:
    - TransmitTimestamp.Value
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: Gets the round-trip time to the server.
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: "Time the request spent traveling to the server plus the time the reply
      spent traveling back.\n This is calculated from timestamps in the packet as
      `(t1 - t0) + (t3 - t2)`\n where t0 is NtpPacket.OriginTimestamp,\n t1 is NtpPacket.ReceiveTimestamp,\n
      t2 is NtpPacket.TransmitTimestamp,\n and t3 is NtpPacket.DestinationTimestamp.\n
      This property throws an exception in request packets."
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
    Since: 
    ObsoleteMsg: 
    Platforms: []
  - TypeFullName: LiteNetLib.Utils.
    MemberName: CheckTimestamps
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 1
    ParamNames:
    - 2
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: Gets the offset that should be added to local time to synchronize it
      with server time.
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: "Time difference between server and client. It should be added to local
      time to get server time.\n It is calculated from timestamps in the packet as
      `0.5 * ((t1 - t0) - (t3 - t2))`\n where t0 is NtpPacket.OriginTimestamp,\n
      t1 is NtpPacket.ReceiveTimestamp,\n t2 is NtpPacket.TransmitTimestamp,\n and
      t3 is NtpPacket.DestinationTimestamp.\n This property throws an exception in
      request packets."
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
