  - TypeFullName: Basis.Shims.
    MemberName: Unsubscribe
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 1
    ParamNames:
    - SyncQuerySubscriptions(
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Removes all subscriptions and handlers for the normalized address.
      This is the \"remove everything for this address\"\n variant: unlike Unsubscribe(string,
      OscMessageEvent), which removes a single handler through\n RemoveCallback{TDelegate}(TDelegate,
      TDelegate), this overload clears the full address entry and all delegates\n
      that were previously added through AddCallback{TDelegate}(TDelegate, TDelegate).\n
      When RemoveCallback{TDelegate}(TDelegate, TDelegate) receives a null callback
      it also removes that callback type,\n which is the same \"remove all\" behavior
      exposed intentionally by Unsubscribe(string)."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
