    Summary: "Apply or release the server-authoritative static / locked state (IBasisStaticLockable).\n
      Locking freezes the rigidbody and disables wheels on every client; unlocking
      restores the normal\n owner/remote state. Sync transmit + apply are short-circuited
      while locked."
